e times at both homes. Set a dated review in late January using Q4 data, with the pause criteria kept in force. Don't discipline night seniors, and don't withdraw the app. Bring the board a clear interim position.\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WFFjE7yub4UVHG5NmfXt1X","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
